Name: Android SDK tool aapt2
Short name: aapt2
Version: N/A
Revision: DEPS
Update Mechanism: Autoroll
URL:  https://dl.google.com/dl/android/maven2/com/android/tools/build/aapt2/${Version}/
Security Critical: no
Shipped: no
License: Apache-2.0

Description:
The host aapt2 tool is released on Google Maven, however as a .jar file that
contains host-specific binaries, which must be extracted. They are distributed
here as a per-platform CIPD package instead. The linux jar holds the Linux
binary; the osx jar holds a universal (x86_64 + arm64) macOS binary.

What version is this:
  * Run print_version.sh to find out the version.
  * New instances are uploaded by the packager bots (one per host platform):
    https://ci.chromium.org/p/chromium/builders/ci/3pp-linux-amd64-packager
    https://ci.chromium.org/p/chromium/builders/ci/3pp-mac-arm64-packager
  * The bots autorun every 6 hours. Ping a trooper or a clank-build-core@ dev to
    trigger them if you need it sooner:
    https://luci-scheduler.appspot.com/jobs/chromium/3pp-linux-amd64-packager
    https://luci-scheduler.appspot.com/jobs/chromium/3pp-mac-arm64-packager
  * New versions are rolled automatically by:
    https://autoroll.skia.org/r/aapt2-chromium

Local Modifications:
None
